{'symbol': 'PWR', 'date': '2023-02-09 06:55:00', 'title': 'QUANTA SERVICES TO RING CLOSING BELL AT THE NEW YORK STOCK EXCHANGE', 'text': "COMPANY CELEBRATES 25-YEAR LISTING ANNIVERSARY HOUSTON , FEB. 9, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- QUANTA SERVICES, INC. (NYSE: PWR) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT DUKE AUSTIN, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF QUANTA SERVICES, WILL RING THE CLOSING BELL AT THE NEW YORK STOCK EXCHANGE THIS AFTERNOON AT 4:00 P.M. EST, MARKING THE COMPANY'S 25TH ANNIVERSARY OF TRADING ON THE PRESTIGIOUS EXCHANGE."}